 blows these figures away by combining the bigger engine with a 150kW electric motor to produce 791 hp and a frankly stunning 1,055 lb-ft. Every S-Class is AWD and deploys a nine-speed automatic transmission. Engine Type\\tHorsepower\\tTorque 3.0 turbo\\t442 hp\\t413 lb-ft 3.0 turbo plug-in hybrid\\t503 hp\\t553 lb-ft 4.0 V8 biturbo\\t496 hp\\t516 lb-ft 4.0 V8 biturbo hybrid\\t791 hp\\t1,055 lb-ft 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Fuel Economy 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class fuel economy stands at an EPA-estimated 21 miles per gallon city, 31 mpg highway, and 24 combined in base S 500 guise. Gas mileage drops in the 580 gas model to 17/25/20 MPG, while figures for the PHEV and AMG versions hadnt been published at the time of writing. 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Towing Capacity Given its luxury orientation, Mercedes-Benz has decided not to quote towing capacities for the S-Class. 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Dimensions & Cargo Capacity 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class dimensions include an overall length of 208 inches, generating 41 and 44 inches of front and rear legroom. 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class cargo space stands at 13 cu ft with the rear seats in place. 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Safety Given its premium status, its unsurprising that the S-Class is imbued with a wealth of standard safety features. There are nine airbags including a front center bag, a dashcam, surround-view cameras, and ultra-wide high beams built into the intelligent LED lighting. Driver aids include torque vectoring braking, active and evasive steering assistance, active blind-spot assistance, and automatic lane changing. AMG models up the ante further with facial recognition and an augmented reality head-up display. 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Technology For decades, the S-Class has led the passenger car market in terms of technology, and the latest generation model wants for nothing. Youll find biometric authentication and voice control with natural language understanding in every model. A 12.3-inch digital inst